      "lineNbr": 171,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-08T15:10:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "WDYT about having this call `findOrCreateDiscardableMSAAAttachment` with `dawnMsaaLoadTextureInfo` instead of having to make `findOrCreateTextureWithKey` a protected function?\n\nThe main implication is that the MSAA attachments and the MSAA load textures share the same ResourceType, but I don\u0027t think that\u0027s a problem in this case.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 168,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 171,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "7c1fcdb7a74edb3d64a32f63a41c6da834260196",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
