      "message": "We shouldn\u0027t have to go through the deferred canvas w/ a replay target for this test.\n\nIf you call `surface-\u003egetCanvas()` and use that for `surfaceCanvas`, everything will go into `surfaceRecorder` automatically, and then when you insert the Recording you\u0027d not specify a replay target.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 4,
